Description: Quick Share client for Linux
 Packet is a partial implementation of Google's Quick Share protocol
 that lets you send and receive files wirelessly from Android devices
 using Quick Share, or another device with Packet.
 .
 It uses GTK 4 and libadwaita for its user interface.